      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "YOUR SHUFFLE (7) had to work when tackling a stronger race last start and was racing well prior with a string of top-four results. She is suited coming back to maiden grade and has winning claims with even luck from the second line. ROCK THE JET (4) has the hoof on the till after coming from the back row for second in both starts so far this time in. Has the benefit of a good draw and is race fit third-up so could break through. ELEANOR STREET (11) is a daughter of Lather Up on debut for the strong Nathan Turnbull yard. Hard to know where she gets to from this slightly awkward draw but looks to have some talent based on a recent trial win at Bathurst. Poster Boy filly TULHURST POSTERGAL (5) has been trialling well enough to be competitive on debut.",
